===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|SM Promo|Popplio|3}}, one of the {{TCG|SM Black Star Promos}}.
*'''Watering''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|HeartGold & SoulSilver|Wooper|88}} from {{TCG|HeartGold & SoulSilver}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Ultra Sun}}.

